 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "一个联盟链网络，所有节点都由成员机构运营。",
   "spoken": "一个联盟链网络，所有节点都由成员机构运营。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.424
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "每个参与者，都持有一张有效的证书。",
   "spoken": "每个参与者，都持有一张有效的证书。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.476,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 6.574,
   "speechEnd": 9.252
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "没有匿名的陌生人，也没有人能靠算力闯进来。",
   "spoken": "没有匿名的陌生人，也没有人能靠算力闯进来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.32,
   "dur": 4.128,
   "speechStart": 10.418,
   "speechEnd": 13.608
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "可就在这样的网络里，账本分叉了。",
   "spoken": "可就在这样的网络里，账本分岔了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.668,
   "dur": 3.552,
   "speechStart": 14.766,
   "speechEnd": 17.385
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "Hyperledger Fabric 公布过这样一个漏洞。",
   "spoken": "Hyperledger Fabric 公布过这样一个漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 18.44,
   "dur": 3.456,
   "speechStart": 18.538,
   "speechEnd": 21.061
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "攻击者能把一个区块里的交易，重新组合。",
   "spoken": "攻击者能把一个区块里的交易，重新组合。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 22.116,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 22.214,
   "speechEnd": 25.118
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "区块哈希没有变。",
   "spoken": "区块哈希没有变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 26.176,
   "dur": 2.304,
   "speechStart": 26.274,
   "speechEnd": 27.655
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "可是不同的节点，从同一个区块里，解析出了不同的交易。",
   "spoken": "可是不同的节点，从同一个区块里，解析出了不同的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 28.7,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 28.798,
   "speechEnd": 32.929
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "收到不同版本的节点，各自写入世界状态，两份账本从此对不上。",
   "spoken": "收到不同版本的节点，各自写入世界状态，两份账本从此对不上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 33.984,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 34.082,
   "speechEnd": 39.201
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "修复的方向是，让哈希的编码没有歧义，同一串字节，只能读出同一组交易。",
   "spoken": "修复的方向是，让哈希的编码没有歧义，同一串字节，只能读出同一组交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 40.252,
   "dur": 6.768,
   "speechStart": 40.35,
   "speechEnd": 46.183
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "这里没有人偷到私钥，也没有人攻破共识。",
   "spoken": "这里没有人偷到私钥，也没有人攻破共识。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-10.mp3",
   "start": 47.24,
   "dur": 3.888,
   "speechStart": 47.338,
   "speechEnd": 50.278
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "门禁再严，挡住的也只是外人。",
   "spoken": "门禁再严，挡住的也只是外人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-11.mp3",
   "start": 51.348,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 51.446,
   "speechEnd": 54.088
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "那么，一个只让熟人进门的区块链，风险到底在哪里？",
   "spoken": "那么，一个只让熟人进门的区块链，风险到底在哪里？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg1-12.mp3",
   "start": 55.144,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 55.242,
   "speechEnd": 59.265
  },
  {
